<title>POLAND: SOCCER-POLAND BEAT MOLDOVA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-POLAND BEAT MOLDOVA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KATOWICE, Poland 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland beat Moldova 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup European group two qualifying</p>
<p>match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Poland: Henryk Baluszynski 4, Krzysztof Warzycha 76 pen</p>
<p>Moldova: Serghei Clescenco 78 pen</p>
<p>Attendance 8,000</p>
<p>Group two standings (tabulated - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, goals against, points):</p>
<p> England		3   3   0   0   7   1   9</p>
<p> Italy		  2   2   0   0   4   1   6</p>
<p> Poland		 2   1   0   1   3   3   3</p>
<p> Georgia		2   0   0   2   0   3   0</p>
<p> Moldova		3   0   0   3   2   8   0</p>
<p>Next match: Feb 12 England v Italy</p>
</text>
